#BNF of BNF
@name   BNF

BNF     Ref | Literal
Ref     \b[A-Z]\w++\b
Literal Escape | Class | Control | Plain
Escape  \\Q(?:(?!\\E).)*+ | \\[pPxN]\{?\w++ | \\[kg][<'{]\w++ | \\.
Class   \[(?:[^[\]\\]|\\.)++
Control \(\*[^)]++ | \(\?(?: \([^)]++ | P[<=>]\w++ | [<'&]\w++ )
Plain   .

@regex  (?P<Ref>\b[A-Z]\w++\b) | (?P<Literal>(?P<Escape>\\Q(?:(?!\\E).)*+ | \\[pPxN]\{?\w++ | \\[kg][<'{]\w++ | \\.) | (?P<Class>\[(?:[^[\]\\]|\\.)++) | (?P<Control>\(\*[^)]++ | \(\?(?: \([^)]++ | P[<=>]\w++ | [<'&]\w++ )) | (?P<Plain>.))